<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Chat Admin — <%= user %></title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/portfolio.css">
<style>
  :root {
    --card-radius: 14px;
    --card-border: var(--border, #dddaf0);
    --card-bg: var(--bg, #fcf8ff);
    --admin-card-accent: var(--primary, #4648d4);
  }

  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .proj-card {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    padding: 20px;
    min-height: 170px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s, transform .15s;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .proj-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--admin-card-accent), rgba(46,125,95,.85));
  }
  .proj-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--admin-card-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(70,72,212,.1);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .card-head {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;
  }
  .card-name {
    font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text, #15131e); line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .card-name a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .card-name a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .card-slug {
    font-family: var(--mono, monospace); font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-dim, #767586); margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .card-badges {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .badge-cv     { background: rgba(124,106,245,0.12); color: #5b4ac4; }
  .badge-tag    { background: rgba(22,160,133,0.12);  color: #0e7a65; }
  .badge-dim    { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.06); color: #666; }

  .card-meta {
    display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .card-meta span {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    min-height: 22px; padding: 3px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border, #e0ddf0); border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--text-dim, #767586);
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .card-actions {
    display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: auto;
  }
  .btn-sm {
    padding: 7px 13px; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid var(--outline, #c7c4d7); background: transparent;
    color: var(--text, #15131e); font-family: inherit; transition: background 0.12s;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
  }
  .btn-sm:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
  .btn-sm.primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-sm.primary:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
  .btn-sm.danger { color: #ba1a1a; border-color: #ffdad6; }
  .btn-sm.danger:hover { background: rgba(186,26,26,0.06); }

  .edit-panel {
    display: none; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }
  .edit-panel.open { display: block; }
  .edit-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .form-row .field { flex: 1; min-width: 100px; }
  .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .field label {
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-dim, #464554);
  }
  .field input, .field select {
    padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 13px; font-family: var(--font, sans-serif);
    border: 1px solid var(--outline, #c7c4d7); border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--bg, #fcf8ff); color: var(--text, #1b1b23);
    outline: none; transition: border-color 0.15s; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,106,245,0.12);
  }
  .field .check-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 13px; padding-top: 4px; }
  .form-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* Tag chips */
  .tag-chip { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; background:var(--surface,#f4f3fb); border:1px solid var(--border,#e5e3f0); border-radius:20px; padding:2px 10px; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-2,#444); white-space:nowrap; }
  .tag-chip.unassigned { background:#fff; border-style:dashed; color:var(--text-muted,#888); }
  .tag-section { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; align-items:center; margin-top:4px; }
  .tag-assign-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .tag-assign-row select { font-size:12px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid var(--border,#e5e3f0); }

  /* Add project card */
  .add-card {
    border: 1px dashed var(--card-border);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    padding: 20px;
    min-height: 170px;
  }
  .add-card summary {
    cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dim, #767586);
    list-style: none;
  }
  .add-card summary::before { content: '+ '; }
</style>
</head>
<body class="admin-page">

<%- include('partials/admin-header', { title: `Hub Admin — ${user}` }) %>

<section class="admin-section">
  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <p>Projects store chat memory. When a user types <code>/slug</code> at the start or end of a message, that exchange is tagged to the project.</p>

  <div class="card-grid">
  <% for (const p of projects) { %>
  <% const pTags = JSON.parse(p.wiki_tags || '[]'); %>
  <div class="proj-card" id="proj-card-<%= p.id %>">
    <div class="card-head">
      <div>
        <div class="card-name"><a href="/admin/projects/<%= p.slug %>"><%= p.name %></a></div>
        <div class="card-slug">/<%= p.slug %></div>
      </div>
      <% if (p.is_cv_context) { %><span class="badge badge-cv">CV</span><% } %>
    </div>

    <% if (pTags.length) { %>
    <div class="card-badges">
      <% for (const t of pTags) { %><span class="badge badge-tag"><%= t %></span><% } %>
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="card-meta">
      <span><%= p.memory_count %> memories</span>
      <span><%= p.context_depth %> ctx depth</span>
      <% if (p.last_activity) { %><span><%= new Date(p.last_activity * 1000).toISOString().slice(0,10) %></span><% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="card-actions">
      <a href="/admin/projects/<%= p.slug %>" class="btn-sm primary">Open</a>
      <button class="btn-sm" onclick="toggleProjEdit('<%= p.id %>')">Edit</button>
    </div>

    <div class="edit-panel" id="proj-edit-<%= p.id %>">
      <form method="POST" action="/admin/projects/<%= p.id %>" class="edit-form">
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label>Name</label>
            <input name="name" value="<%= p.name %>" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Slug</label>
            <input name="slug" value="<%= p.slug %>" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label>Context depth</label>
            <input name="context_depth" type="number" value="<%= p.context_depth %>">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>CV context</label>
            <div class="check-row">
              <input type="checkbox" name="is_cv_context" value="1" <%= p.is_cv_context ? 'checked' : '' %>>
              <span>Include in CV</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-sm primary">Save</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn-sm" onclick="toggleProjEdit('<%= p.id %>')">Cancel</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <form method="POST" action="/admin/projects/<%= p.id %>/delete" style="margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--card-border);" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete project <%= p.slug %> and its memories?')">
        <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px;">
          <input type="checkbox" name="keep_messages" value="1"> Keep messages (just untag)
        </label>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-sm danger">Delete project</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="add-card">
    <details>
      <summary>Add project</summary>
      <form method="POST" action="/admin/projects" class="edit-form" style="margin-top:12px;">
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label>Name</label>
            <input name="name" placeholder="e.g. Beacon" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Slug</label>
            <input name="slug" placeholder="beacon" required pattern="[a-z0-9-]+">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label>Context depth</label>
            <input name="context_depth" type="number" value="20">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>CV context</label>
            <div class="check-row">
              <input type="checkbox" name="is_cv_context" value="1">
              <span>Include in CV</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-sm primary">Add project</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </details>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="admin-section">
  <h2>MCP endpoints</h2>
  <p>For a future MCP server to read this project memory. Send <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code> (set <code><%= user === 'douglas' ? 'DCHAT_MCP_TOKEN' : 'NCHAT_MCP_TOKEN' %></code> in the server <code>.env</code>).</p>
  <ul style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;">
    <li>GET <code>/mcp/projects</code> — list projects with memory counts</li>
    <li>GET <code>/mcp/projects/:slug</code> — fetch memories (query: <code>?since=unix_ts&amp;limit=500</code>)</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<script>
window.toggleProjEdit = function(id) {
  const panel = document.getElementById('proj-edit-' + id);
  if (panel) panel.classList.toggle('open');
};
</script>

</body>
</html>
